# Local Deploy: Single Port + Single Instance

When running local production preview, use only port `4175` and do not create multiple preview servers.

## Required behavior

- Always use `http://127.0.0.1:4175/` for local deploy preview.
- Do not use auto-port fallback (`--strictPort false`).
- Before starting a new preview server, check for an existing running preview and reuse it, or stop it first.
- Never leave multiple `vite preview` instances running in parallel.

## Command standard

```bash
# ✅ Required (build + build-meta + preview on 4175)
npm run deploy:local
```

```bash
# ❌ Not allowed for local deploy
vite preview --host 127.0.0.1 --strictPort false
# `vite preview` without a fresh `npm run build` first (serves stale dist/)
```
